Cell["\<\
It is working but it would be nice to have the corner in the right place and \
the step down of size 1.  It would also be nice if it did not look wobbly and \
did not throw warnings.   The warnings are very specifically to do with the \
warnings.  \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9846463675919294`*^9, 3.984646378711625*^9}, {
  3.984646519806814*^9, 3.984646588230096*^9}, {3.984646814243143*^9, 
  3.984646867178872*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ea52b152-430e-4864-8967-\
5a6050f16007"],

Cell["What suggestions do people have to fix these issues.  ", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9846467880993133`*^9, 3.984646809555267*^9}, {
  3.9846468727856526`*^9, 
  3.984646875730618*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7f606928-e921-445a-883c-\
